WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
[Distant water]

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.800
[Parcel lifted; cloth rustles]

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.400
Malati: Bapa…

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.400
Raghu Sadhaba: Have I forgotten to bring something?

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Malati: No. I don’t need anything.

6
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.800
[A small shift along the bench]

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.400
Malati: Sit a little longer.

8
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.400
[Parcel settles on the ground]

9
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.800
[Cloth settles as he sits]

10
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.400
Raghu Sadhaba: All right. We can sit a little.

11
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.000
[Quiet water and distant work]
